      "writtenOn": "2026-08-04T19:28:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m afraid that having long intervals doesn\u0027t have much value for this feature and having short intervals quickly fills up storage ?\n\nCan we enable this on-demand via ssh/rest ?",
      "revId": "b07d7f2f08b66a39b7a56a79bf3a7c350e922ab8",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
